00:00:28.497 --> 00:00:30.050
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> Yes, fine now!

00:00:30.743 --> 00:00:34.269
Hello, I’m Harry, from English House Language School.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:36.262
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> Hi, Harry.

